---
import AviorMark from '../components/AviorMark.astro';
import Full from '../layouts/Full.astro';
---

<Full
	title="Avior Studio — Small worlds. Useful tools."
	description="Independent games, a terminal arcade, and developer tools built from the work of making them. Play termcade, meet Fianchetto and Castle Drop, and explore gdam and gdlint."
>
	<main id="main-content">
		<section class="cover">
			<AviorMark class="cover-mark" />
			<p class="eyebrow"><span class="seal"></span> Independent games &amp; developer tools</p>
			<h1>
				Small worlds.
				<em>Big possibilities.</em>
			</h1>
			<p class="cover-lede">Games worth getting lost in, and the tools that help us get there.</p>
			<div class="cover-actions">
				<a class="studio-button" href="/games">Explore our worlds <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				<a class="quiet-link" href="/devtools">The workbench</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
			<div class="section-line">
				<h2 id="work-title">Worlds in the making</h2>
				<a href="/games">All games →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="game-grid">
				<a class="game-art castle" href="/games#castle-drop">
					<div class="castle-scene">
						<img
							src="/art/castledrop-fight.webp"
							alt="A Castle Drop fight: goblins march down the field toward the castle wall past a new archer tower, with a hand of cards below"
							width="1280"
							height="720"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="game-caption">
						<div>
							<h3>Castle Drop</h3>
							<p>Draw cards. Raise towers. Hold the wall.</p>
						</div>
						<span>PLAYABLE NOW</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="game-art fianchetto" href="/games#fianchetto">
					<div class="fianchetto-scene">
						<img
							src="/art/fianchetto-black-queen.webp"
							alt="Fianchetto's Black Queen between two dark rooks in a ruined hall"
							width="680"
							height="441"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="game-caption">
						<div>
							<h3>Fianchetto</h3>
							<p>Start with a king. Play the rest from your hand.</p>
						</div>
						<span>IN DEVELOPMENT</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="arcade-strip">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow"><span class="seal"></span> Play something right now</p>
				<h2>
					An arcade.
					<em>In your terminal.</em>
				</h2>
				<p>Asteroid, Tetris and Brickough. A small collection of classics, rendered in the place you already work.</p>
				<a class="studio-button" href="https://www.termca.de">Meet termcade <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</div>
			<div class="pixel-art" aria-hidden="true">
				<span>▟▙</span>
				<b>▐▛▀▜▌</b>
				<span>▝▘ ▝▘</span>
				<small>INSERT COMMAND</small>
				<code>go run github.com/aviorstudio/termcade@latest</code>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="tool-story">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow"><span class="seal"></span> From the workbench</p>
				<h2>
					Better tools.
					<em>More time to play.</em>
				</h2>
				<p>
					The games share more than a studio. Their addons, script checks and artwork grow from the same workbench,
					down to the ibis at the top of this page: painted once, cut into parts and animated with spritesmith.
				</p>
				<a class="quiet-link" href="/devtools">Explore the devtools →</a>
			</div>
			<div class="tool-links">
				<a href="https://gdam.dev">
					<span>01</span>
					<div>
						<h3>gdam</h3>
						<p>Godot addons. Installed and pinned.</p>
					</div>
					<b>↗</b>
				</a>
				<a href="https://gdlint.dev">
					<span>02</span>
					<div>
						<h3>gdlint</h3>
						<p>Keep the GDScript tidy.</p>
					</div>
					<b>↗</b>
				</a>
				<div class="tool-note">
					<span>03</span>
					<div>
						<h3>spritesmith</h3>
						<p>
							Game art from Python to the screen. Castle Drop's painted towers and goblins are its cut-out puppets,
							and so is the ibis at the top of this page.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Full>
<style>
	.cover {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
		margin: 0 auto 110px;
		padding: 24px 0 0;
	}
	.cover :global(.cover-mark) {
		width: min(440px, 82vw);
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--quiet);
		font: 500 11px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cover h1 {
		margin: 22px 0 18px;
		color: var(--bone);
		font: 400 clamp(46px, 6vw, 80px) / 1.04 var(--serif);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.cover h1 em,
	.arcade-strip h2 em,
	.tool-story h2 em {
		display: block;
		color: var(--quiet);
		font-style: italic;
	}
	.cover-lede {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--quiet);
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.cover-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 28px;
		margin-top: 36px;
	}
	.studio-button {
		display: inline-flex;
		gap: 26px;
		background: var(--paper);
		color: var(--ink);
		padding: 16px 24px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		border-radius: 2px;
		transition: background 0.15s ease;
	}
	.studio-button:hover {
		background: #fff;
	}
	.quiet-link {
		color: var(--paper);
		font-size: 13px;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
		padding: 4px 0;
		transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
	}
	.quiet-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--paper);
	}
	.work,
	.tool-story,
	.arcade-strip {
		width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 64px));
		margin: 0 auto 110px;
	}
	.section-line {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
		padding-bottom: 18px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
	}
	.section-line h2 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--bone);
		font: 400 30px var(--serif);
	}
	.section-line a {
		color: var(--quiet);
		font-size: 13px;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.section-line a:hover {
		color: var(--bone);
	}
	.game-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 26px 30px;
	}
	.game-art {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}
	.fianchetto-scene,
	.castle-scene {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: 3px;
	}
	.fianchetto-scene {
		background: #3a2b33;
	}
	.fianchetto-scene img,
	.castle-scene img {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 30%;
		transition: transform 0.6s;
	}
	.game-art.fianchetto:hover .fianchetto-scene img,
	.game-art.castle:hover .castle-scene img {
		transform: scale(1.03);
	}
	.fianchetto-scene,
	.castle-scene {
		height: 340px;
	}
	.castle-scene {
		background: #a8c66c;
	}
	.castle-scene img {
		object-position: center 45%;
	}
	.game-caption {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 18px 0 0;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.game-caption h3 {
		margin: 0 0 5px;
		color: var(--bone);
		font: 400 22px var(--serif);
	}
	.game-caption p {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--quiet);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.game-caption > span {
		color: var(--faint);
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.game-art:hover .game-caption > span {
		color: var(--bone);
	}
	.arcade-strip {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		background: var(--ink-deep);
		border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
		border-radius: 3px;
		padding: 60px;
		gap: 40px;
	}
	.arcade-strip h2,
	.tool-story h2 {
		margin: 22px 0;
		color: var(--bone);
		font: 400 46px / 1.1 var(--serif);
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}
	.arcade-strip p:not(.eyebrow),
	.tool-story p:not(.eyebrow) {
		max-width: 440px;
		margin: 0 0 30px;
		color: var(--quiet);
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 15px;
	}
	.pixel-art {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font: 70px/1 var(--mono);
		color: var(--paper);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.pixel-art b {
		font-weight: 400;
	}
	.pixel-art small {
		color: var(--seal);
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		margin-top: 30px;
	}
	.pixel-art code {
		color: var(--faint);
		font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono);
		margin-top: 15px;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}
	.tool-story {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 90px;
		padding: 10px 0 30px;
	}
	.tool-links > a,
	.tool-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: start;
		gap: 25px;
		padding: 28px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.tool-links > a:hover h3 {
		color: #fff;
	}
	.tool-links span {
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		margin-top: 7px;
		color: var(--faint);
	}
	.tool-links h3 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--bone);
		font: 400 26px var(--serif);
	}
	.tool-links p {
		margin: 7px 0 0;
		color: var(--quiet);
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.tool-links b {
		margin-left: auto;
		color: var(--faint);
		font-weight: 400;
	}
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.tool-story {
			gap: 40px;
		}
		.fianchetto-scene,
		.castle-scene {
			height: 280px;
		}
		.arcade-strip {
			padding: 40px;
		}
		.pixel-art {
			font-size: 50px;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cover {
			margin-bottom: 70px;
			padding-top: 8px;
		}
		.cover-lede {
			font-size: 16px;
		}
		.work,
		.tool-story,
		.arcade-strip {
			width: calc(100% - 32px);
			margin-bottom: 70px;
		}
		.game-grid,
		.tool-story,
		.arcade-strip {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.section-line h2 {
			font-size: 24px;
		}
		.section-line a {
			font-size: 12px;
		}
		.arcade-strip {
			padding: 32px 24px;
			gap: 30px;
		}
		.arcade-strip h2,
		.tool-story h2 {
			font-size: 36px;
		}
		.pixel-art {
			padding: 10px 0;
		}
		.game-caption p {
			font-size: 12px;
		}
		.tool-story {
			gap: 30px;
		}
	}
</style>
